### Listar status de contrato com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/contractstatus?registers=10&page=1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Obter todos os status de contrato
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/contractstatus/all
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}
